4. Project Description
    This customized PostgreSQL service implements CDC capabilities: it parses logical replication logs into JSON format and pushes data to Kafka. The decoding process runs on replica nodes to isolate workload from the primary database.
    WAL replay logic is disabled inside the program, making the database a stateless service.
    HA deployment is supported via repmgr, Patroni or Kubernetes. Two deployment modes are available:
        - Single data copy on shared storage or remote NAS (active-standby mode);
        - Three data copies for standard 3-node repmgr/patroni or others clusters.

Important Notice:
    Optimize Kafka configuration parameters properly to prevent memory overflow and Kafka cluster overload.